WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:06.169
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie, this is my Constantine
Episode 2 video.

00:00:06.169 --> 00:00:08.450
It was almost like a second first episode.

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:10.580
We got to meet Zed, she’s the new female
lead character.

00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:13.450
So I’ll explain her backstory in the comics.

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:17.790
They changed the show just a little after
the pilot was shot, so I’ll explain what

00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:21.650
they kept, namely the Map which is going to
be what they use to find new dark arts to

00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:24.490
dabble in all over the united states.

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:30.750
Careful for spoilers if you’re not caught
up, starting with Top 5 Moments

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:32.330
Number 5 - Constantine Road Trip

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:35.629
They’ll be traveling all over the place
using that map.

00:00:35.629 --> 00:00:38.460
This week it was a middle of nowhere mining
town in Pennsylvania.

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:41.679
I was surprised they didn’t pick a bigger
location for their second episode but the

00:00:41.679 --> 00:00:44.469
explanation for why it had to be a small town
ties back into the bigger Dark Constantine/Demon

00:00:44.469 --> 00:00:45.980
plot teased in episode 1.

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:46.980
Evil is spreading everywhere, including dead
mining towns.

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:48.920
The miner did tunnel into a supernatural area.

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:51.309
But that’s not what made all the Coblinau
go crazy.

00:00:51.309 --> 00:00:52.460
It didn’t help either.

00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:55.210
The spreading darkness that we’ll just see
in all of the episodes threw gasoline on the

00:00:55.210 --> 00:00:56.210
flames.

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.870
It gave the gypsy woman’s power extra juice
and it forced more of the coblinau to manifest.

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:04.199
I don’t expect them to explain this spreading
evil right away, we probably won’t learn

00:01:04.199 --> 00:01:08.440
what it’s all about until we learn what
the inner circle of demons are planning.

00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:09.940
Number 4 - The Coblinau Spirits

00:01:09.940 --> 00:01:14.770
There aren’t a lot of details about these
spirits in the comics but in classic mythology

00:01:14.770 --> 00:01:16.320
they’re a lot like Cave Goblins.

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:20.820
Here they’re the trapped spirits of dead
miners.

00:01:20.820 --> 00:01:24.950
Remember, Constantine explained that the spirits
you can see on earth are trapped, they’re

00:01:24.950 --> 00:01:26.140
not supposed to be here.

00:01:26.140 --> 00:01:35.110
That’s why Heaven was so freaked out in
the first episode they sent Manny to enlist

00:01:35.110 --> 00:01:37.580
Constantine’s help.

00:01:37.580 --> 00:01:44.890
The mining operation just shook them up a
bit, they gypsy was what turned them into

00:01:44.890 --> 00:01:45.890
killers.

00:01:45.890 --> 00:01:48.111
They were made out of mud, which is why constantine
almost drowned in mud inside that car.

00:01:48.111 --> 00:01:50.800
They reminded me visually of Melisandre’s
shadow baby from Game of Thrones.

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:54.920
It’s getting a lot easier for television
to do visual effects like this, so expect

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:57.020
some more cool looking creature effects this
season.

00:01:57.020 --> 00:02:00.680
They won’t just be dealing with Demons,
it will be all manner of spirits and supernatural

00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:01.680
creatures.

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:04.280
I know everyone is bummed this is never going
to cross over with Supermantural on the CW,

00:02:04.280 --> 00:02:05.920
because Team Winchester exists in pretty much
the same universe.

00:02:05.920 --> 00:02:06.920
Not literally, but the two shows look very
similar.

00:02:06.920 --> 00:02:08.229
Number 3 - Constantine Dabbles In The Dark
Arts

00:02:08.229 --> 00:02:12.680
I don’t think him casting the spell on the
jar of water was dark magic, but I was waiting

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:15.609
for him to use some of his powers in a visual
way.

00:02:15.609 --> 00:02:21.249
He does have powers but most of the time he
works through other agents like Zed who have

00:02:21.249 --> 00:02:22.879
much more specific abilities.

00:02:22.879 --> 00:02:32.930
Constantine’s supernatural ability in the
comics 

00:02:32.930 --> 00:02:34.549
allows him to create his own luck.

00:02:34.549 --> 00:02:37.069
He uses it to talk his way out of situations.

00:02:37.069 --> 00:02:41.189
He’s claimed to have pulled a fast one on
both Lucifer and God.

00:02:41.189 --> 00:02:45.499
So when Zed asked him what he was going to
use for protection and he said my wits.

00:02:45.499 --> 00:02:46.639
That was what he was talking about.

00:02:46.639 --> 00:02:49.629
When he’s on his game he can talk his way
out of anything.

00:02:49.629 --> 00:02:53.810
He’s a pretty epic mess of a human being
though, so his wits don’t save him from

00:02:53.810 --> 00:02:55.829
getting his ass handed to him on a regular
basis.

00:02:55.829 --> 00:02:57.120
I also love that the priest just waves off
his incantation to try and stop him.

00:02:57.120 --> 00:02:58.920
It’s just the show telling us that constantine
isn’t invincible.

00:02:58.920 --> 00:03:00.340
People call bullshit on him all the time.

00:03:00.340 --> 00:03:02.370
Now that we have Zed, there will be a lot
more of that.

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:04.389
Just much more playful.

00:03:04.389 --> 00:03:07.170
Number 2 - You Need Faith To Raise Evil

00:03:07.170 --> 00:03:11.579
Constantine was able to raise the dead husband’s
spirit, so he must have a little bit of faith

00:03:11.579 --> 00:03:12.579
in him.

00:03:12.579 --> 00:03:16.529
He does despise both Heaven and Hell, but
his spells wouldn’t have any power if he

00:03:16.529 --> 00:03:17.529
didn’t have faith.

00:03:17.529 --> 00:03:19.420
They also had a big call out to that in the
first episode.

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:22.569
When the shadow constantine said his spells
lack the power of conviction.

00:03:22.569 --> 00:03:25.579
I expect them to pay off that idea at least
a few more times.

00:03:25.579 --> 00:03:29.370
His faith will be tested, he’ll fail and
then have some big epic success against one

00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:30.659
of the big villains.

00:03:30.659 --> 00:03:32.450
All part of the heroe’s Journey.

00:03:32.450 --> 00:03:36.150
Him raising the evil spirit was also a nice
callback to his story about Astrid being drug

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:38.189
to hell by a demon he raised.

00:03:38.189 --> 00:03:39.529
That’s one of the bigger arcs.

00:03:39.529 --> 00:03:42.599
I don’t know if they’ll take the series
that far in season 1.

00:03:42.599 --> 00:03:48.709
If they’ll let Constantine go to hell to
rescue her.

00:03:48.709 --> 00:03:50.060
That’s something we haven’t seen yet.

00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:51.060
Constantine actually in Hell.

00:03:51.060 --> 00:03:52.079
I feel like that’s coming.

00:03:52.079 --> 00:03:54.379
and my Number 1 moment - Meet Zed Martin

00:03:54.379 --> 00:03:57.390
Okay, so if you haven’t read the comcis,
Zed is from Hellblazer.

00:03:57.390 --> 00:04:00.209
She appeared for the first time in Hellblazer
number 4.

00:04:00.209 --> 00:04:01.700
So she’s old school.

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:07.800
Over the years she and Constantine have had
an on again off again sexual relationship.

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:14.309
She’s the female lead so she’d have to
have sexual chemistry with her co-star.

00:04:14.309 --> 00:04:16.010
But they pushed it pretty far in the episode
and that’s why.

00:04:16.010 --> 00:04:18.010
They were a huge thing in the comics.

00:04:18.010 --> 00:04:21.669
One of her big story arcs was Ressurection
Crusade.

00:04:21.669 --> 00:04:26.340
She was targeted by a cult led by her father
to become the vessel for the next messaih.

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:32.010
But she had sex with constantine the night
before the ritual and they required a virgin.

00:04:32.010 --> 00:04:34.830
It gets ugly and she dies while it’s all
going down.

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:39.500
I don’t think the show will kill off Angelica
Celaya anytime soon.

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:41.970
So just expect them to avoid that storyline
on the show.

00:04:41.970 --> 00:04:47.410
All in total she was around in the comics
for a little over 30 issues.

00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:51.620
She was a really big deal so it’s awesome
that they’re doing her on the show.

00:04:51.620 --> 00:04:55.849
Let me know, What was your favorite moment
and what do you think of Zed so far?

00:04:55.849 --> 00:04:59.770
While you think about that, here are a few
easter eggs I spotted.

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:01.770
First are Constantine’s Tattoos.

00:05:01.770 --> 00:05:05.720
We only see them on him in the episode, but
the movie made them a big thing.

00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:10.190
They’re a proprietary blend of custom runes.

00:05:10.190 --> 00:05:13.349
and We got a much better look at Zed’s charcoal
drawings.

00:05:13.349 --> 00:05:15.810
They’re all covers of Hellblazer comics.

00:05:15.810 --> 00:05:21.600
Let me know if you spotted any other big references,
just write them in the comments.

00:05:21.600 --> 00:05:25.000
Overall I gave the episode a B, I thought
it was stronger than the Pilot.

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:29.690
But Pilot’s change so much, usually second
episodes get better.

00:05:29.690 --> 00:05:33.490
Producers and writers are able to fix things
they don’t think worked, recast actors if

00:05:33.490 --> 00:05:36.000
they need to.

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:41.360
It’s going to be a few more episodes before
we get into the rhythm of the characters.

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:45.350
And even though I love Lucy Griffiths I feel
like the Zed character is a much better foil

00:05:45.350 --> 00:05:46.490
for Constantine.

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:50.490
I’m going to give them a few episodes together
before I pass judgement but so far I like

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:51.490
their energy.

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:54.460
They have a very honeymoon suite kind of energy.

00:05:54.460 --> 00:05:57.580
Next week I think the other main characters
are back, so we should get to see the full

00:05:57.580 --> 00:05:58.879
team in action.

00:05:58.879 --> 00:06:02.000
The real purpose of this episode was to intro
the Zed character.

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:04.220
I loved the way they played that ending too.

00:06:04.220 --> 00:06:07.820
They’re presenting her as equal parts bad
and good for Constantine.

00:06:07.820 --> 00:06:12.360
They have this weird symbiotic relationship
where they’re really awesome and really

00:06:12.360 --> 00:06:21.379
bad for each other at the same time.

00:06:21.379 --> 00:06:23.789
Next week, Papa Midnite from the comics is
joining the show.

00:06:23.789 --> 00:06:25.310
So be sure to subscribe to get my video.

00:06:25.310 --> 00:06:26.960
I’ll post it after the episode airs.

